WEBVTT

00:18:27.913 --> 00:18:36.288
Well, when I look back at my life, it's
been a series of things that, you know,

00:18:36.288 --> 00:18:40.704
ultimately I made decisions,
made life choices clearly,

00:18:41.371 --> 00:18:43.288
but I did not experience them.

00:18:44.496 --> 00:18:51.954
As decisions, I have very little to say,
describing myself about making decisions,

00:18:52.121 --> 00:18:59.579
in part because I have really strong
intuitions and I follow them usually.

00:18:59.913 --> 00:19:05.329
So the decision doesn't feel hard if if
you know what you are going to do